Added `direct`, `can_manage` and a per-row `type` to `@group-members`. `direct=1` lists what a change of members acts on: the groups nested in the group through their own `group_ids`, then the people in the group itself. `can_manage` says whether `plone.restapi`'s `PATCH @groups/<id>` would accept a change of members from the caller. Somebody with `Plone Site Setup: Users and Groups`, such as a Site Administrator, may now read any group's members, as they could already change them. @ericof
